        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carlo Ancelotti, Lorenzo Bandini, Anna Isabella Gonzaga, Ferdinando Carlo Gonzaga\n- Places: Reggiolo, Guastalla, Luzzara, Mantua, Montferrat, Germany\n- Roles: football manager, Formula One racer, Duchess consort, Duke\n- Organizations: Bayern Munich\n\nFacts:\n- Anna Isabella Gonzaga was born on 12 February 1655 and died on 11 August 1703.\n- In 1671, Anna Isabella Gonzaga married Ferdinando Carlo Gonzaga, Duke of Mantua and Montferrat.\n- Anna Isabella Gonzaga was Duchess consort of Mantua and Montferrat and heir of the Duchy of Guastalla, including Luzzara and Reggiolo.\n- Carlo Ancelotti is a native of Reggiolo.\n- Lorenzo Bandini was a Formula One racer whose funeral was held in Reggiolo.\n- Carlo Ancelotti last served as manager of the German club Bayern Munich.",
